    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin generates alternative text for images stored in the WordPress media library.</p>\n<p>It helps improve accessibility and supports better image metadata management within WordPress.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the Plugins screen.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20modify%20existing%20images%3F\">\nDoes this modify existing images?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>The plugin updates the alternative text field of selected images.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Removed WordPress.org directory assets from the plugin package.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
